{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09979","headline":"长孙十一东山春夜见赠 · 杨谏","name":"长孙十一东山春夜见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人谢城阙，挥手碧云期。\n谿月照隐处，松风生兴时。\n旧林日云暮，芳草岁空滋。\n甘与子成梦，请君同所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨谏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}